@url = http://localhost:5103

### Health check
GET {{url}}/health

### Listar reservas
GET {{url}}/api/reservas

### Criar reserva (substitua os dois IDs)
POST {{url}}/api/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "quadraId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "data": "2026-11-27",
  "horarioInicio": "19:00:00",
  "horarioFim": "20:00:00"
}
